---
If you use this code or build upon this training pipeline, please cite: Narimissa, Esmaeil. Reasoning on a Budget: Miniaturizing DeepSeek R1 with SFT-GRPO Alignment for Instruction-Tuned LLMs . TechRxiv, May 2025. DOI: 10.36227/techrxiv.174742969.91776650/v1
